<title>JAPAN: Hanshin Department - 6mth parent results.</title>
<headline>Hanshin Department - 6mth parent results.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-11-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to September 30, 1996</p>
<p> (Parent)	(in billions of yen unless specified)</p>
<p> Revenues	    54.50		vs	   54.24</p>
<p> Operating	  706    mln	  vs	  603    mln</p>
<p> Current	    883    mln	  vs	  770    mln</p>
<p> Net		  502    mln	  vs	  490    mln</p>
<p> EPS		   12.48 yen	  vs	   12.18 yen</p>
<p> Shares	     40 million	  vs	  40 million</p>
<p> Interim div	  3.75 yen	  vs	    3.75 yen</p>
<p>NOTE - Hanshin Department Store Ltd is a department store operator in Osaka.</p>
